WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.627
Every wheel.

2
00:00:01.627 --> 00:00:03.147
Every spring.

3
00:00:03.147 --> 00:00:05.278
Every bridge and screw.

4
00:00:05.278 --> 00:00:08.516
Each has a place in this little universe.

5
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.348
And now... everything comes together.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.603
Three hundred and eighty components, united in calibre nine thousand and one.

7
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.258
One extraordinary watch.

8
00:00:31.258 --> 00:00:33.303
A world on your wrist.

